    "turn_text": "Welcome back to Special Session. Today, my very good friend and very special guest as well. That's Mr. Lee Gibson, who is the Executive Director of the Washoe County Regional Transportation Commission. We've been friends for many, many years. Lee, let's talk about how you ended up in Nevada and how we got to know each other, if you would, please.",
